# frontierinfra/jebadiah:4b, Jebadiah 4B v2 (Q4_K_M), a decision model from Frontier Infra.
# Weights: https://huggingface.co/frontier-infra/jebadiah-4b-v2-GGUF (Apache-2.0, base Qwen3.5).
# Jebadiah is not a chat model. It returns probabilities over typed option labels.
# Ask it through a decision server (jeb serve) or decide_ollama.py in raw mode, thinking off.
# publish.sh downloads jebadiah-4b-v2-Q4_K_M.gguf next to this file, then runs ollama create.
FROM ./jebadiah-4b-v2-Q4_K_M.gguf
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
LICENSE """Apache License 2.0. https://huggingface.co/frontier-infra/jebadiah-4b-v2-GGUF/blob/main/LICENSE"""
